<title>INDIA: Port conditions update -India - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update -India - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>INDIA, July 11 - Tuticorin - Stevedore labour on strike against employing private or casual labour, has been affecting vessels in port since July 8. Discussions are taking place and the strike was expected to be called off on Monday, July 14.</p>
</text>
